  "bio": "\"Stitch Mainz, nestled in the heart of Mainz, Germany, offers an elegant fusion of black & gray and neotraditional tattoo artistry. Our studio boasts a serene and creative environment where our artists dedicate their skill to crafting personalized, timeless body art. Explore our unique aesthetic online at www.stitch-mainz.de and join us for an unparalleled tattooing experience.\"\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Mainz, Rhineland-palatinate, Germany\n\nPIERCING WALK INS\nMo.-Mi.-Fr.: 14 bis 18 Uhr \nDi.-Do.: 14 bis 20 Uhr \nSamstag: nach Terminvereinbarung⬇️",
